EN:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}good evening!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}We've turned this into {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}countdown{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
central for ringing in the new year!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'd love if you'd join us here tonight
to help celebrate the event!

IT:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}ti aspettavo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
